WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.023
The appointment moved.

00:00:02.023 --> 00:00:03.276
The ride didn't.

00:00:03.276 --> 00:00:06.173
Everyone thought someone else had it.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.278
Everyone has part of the story.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.428
Meet Carestead.

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:14.554
A shared place for care.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.538
Carestead brings the plan, people, and follow-through into one place.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.023
A clear next step.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:25.097
A caregiver in control.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.609
Less time chasing updates.

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:29.393
More time being there.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.551
Carestead.

00:00:31.551 --> 00:00:33.163
Less to carry.

00:00:33.163 --> 00:00:35.236
More care to give.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.315
You care.

00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:38.483
We plan.
